# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This circuit simulates 4 Trotter steps of a 22-qubit transverse-field Ising Hamiltonian on a hexagonal lattice. The 22 data qubits are embedded in a 49-qubit heavy-hex subgraph of the Heron r3 QPU, ``ibm_boston``. The 27 ancilla qubits are used for two purposes: mediating entanglement between the Ising qubits and detecting logical errors during circuit execution. The circuit's entangling layers are implemented such that the mediator qubits return to the ground state $|0\\rangle$ before their terminal measurements. One or more mediator qubits measuring $|1\\rangle$ indicates that the sample was corrupted by a logical error. Discarding these samples can improve the fidelity of the sampled distribution.\n"
msgstr "Sini-simulate ng circuit na ito ang 4 na Trotter step ng isang 22-qubit na transverse-field Ising Hamiltonian sa isang hexagonal lattice. Ang 22 data qubit ay naka-embed sa isang 49-qubit na heavy-hex subgraph ng Heron r3 QPU, ``ibm_boston``. Ginagamit ang 27 ancilla qubit para sa dalawang layunin: pag-mediate ng entanglement sa pagitan ng mga Ising qubit at pagtukoy ng logical errors habang isinasagawa ang circuit. Ipinapatupad ang mga entangling layer ng circuit sa paraang bumabalik sa ground state $|0\\rangle$ ang mga mediator qubit bago ang kanilang mga terminal measurement. Ang isa o higit pang mediator qubit na nagbabasa ng $|1\\rangle$ ay nagpapahiwatig na ang sample ay nasira ng isang logical error. Ang pagtatapon sa mga sample na ito ay maaaring magpabuti sa fidelity ng na-sample na distribution.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
