# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sample the error-detecting circuit {#sample-the-error-detecting-circuit}"
msgstr "I-sample ang error-detecting circuit {#sample-the-error-detecting-circuit}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here we sample the 49-qubit error-detecting Ising circuit. We enable Pauli twirling and non-Markovian error checks, but we do not perform PEC sampling. We will use these samples to calculate baseline expectation values as well as error-detection-only expectation values.\n"
msgstr "Dito, sina-sample natin ang 49-qubit na error-detecting Ising circuit. Pinapagana natin ang Pauli twirling at non-Markovian error checks, ngunit hindi tayo nagsasagawa ng PEC sampling. Gagamitin natin ang mga sample na ito upang kalkulahin ang baseline expectation values gayundin ang error-detection-only na expectation values.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sample the error-detecting circuit with PEC {#sample-the-error-detecting-circuit-with-pec}"
msgstr "I-sample ang error-detecting circuit gamit ang PEC {#sample-the-error-detecting-circuit-with-pec}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now we sample again and include PEC randomizations to mitigate the noise the symmetry checks can't detect. These samples will be used to calculate expectation values by using error detection in combination with PEC. Below we plot the accepted shots per PEC randomization against a binomial at the mean acceptance rate. We see that acceptance is uncorrelated with the sampled circuit instance because QED+PEC injects only undetectable Paulis, which commute with the measurements of every mediator qubit.\n"
msgstr "Ngayon, nag-sample tayo ulit at isinasama ang PEC randomizations upang bawasan ang noise na hindi matukoy ng symmetry checks. Gagamitin ang mga sample na ito upang kalkulahin ang expectation values sa pamamagitan ng paggamit ng error detection kasabay ng PEC. Sa ibaba, ipinlot natin ang tinanggap na shots kada PEC randomization laban sa isang binomial sa average na acceptance rate. Nakikita natin na hindi konektado ang acceptance sa na-sample na circuit instance dahil ang QED+PEC ay nagta-inject lamang ng mga undetectable na Pauli, na commute sa mga measurement ng bawat mediator qubit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Collect the samples and verify that PEC randomizations commute with the measurements on the mediator qubits and do not affect the postselection statistics.\n"
msgstr "Kolektahin ang mga sample at i-verify na ang PEC randomizations ay commute sa mga measurement sa mediator qubits at hindi nakakaapekto sa postselection statistics.\n"

