# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Calculate expectation values and compare strategies {#calculate-expectation-values-and-compare-strategies}"
msgstr "Kalkulahin ang expectation values at ikumpara ang mga estratehiya {#calculate-expectation-values-and-compare-strategies}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Finally, we calculate all of the expectation values with the ``executor_expectation_values`` helper function from ``qiskit-mitigation``, which applies the measurement flips, the postselection masks, the TREX rescale factors, and the quasi-probability signs for us.\n"
msgstr "Sa wakas, kinakalkula natin ang lahat ng expectation values gamit ang helper function na ``executor_expectation_values`` mula sa ``qiskit-mitigation``, na naglalapat ng measurement flips, postselection masks, TREX rescale factors, at quasi-probability signs para sa atin.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Top chart:** We see that both PEC variants converge, but QED+PEC reaches the $\\pm 0.025$ band with fewer randomizations and tighter error bars. The residual bias in the QED+PEC calculation is below 0.01 and can be attributed to some combination of noise model disagreement, qubit drift over time, and effects from unmodeled noise sources.\n"
msgstr "**Chart sa itaas:** Nakikita natin na kapwa nagko-converge ang dalawang variant ng PEC, ngunit umaabot ang QED+PEC sa $\\pm 0.025$ na band na may mas kaunting randomizations at mas mahigpit na error bars. Ang residual bias sa kalkulasyon ng QED+PEC ay mas mababa sa 0.01 at maaaring maiugnay sa kombinasyon ng hindi pagkakatugma ng noise model, paglihis ng qubit sa paglipas ng panahon, at mga epekto mula sa mga hindi na-model na noise source.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Bottom chart**: The running estimate of the site-averaged $\\langle X \\rangle$ as randomizations accumulate using identical shots per randomization for both PEC variants. PEC + error detection settles into the band within a few thousand randomizations; PEC-only, paying the full sampling overhead, requires many more randomizations to converge.\n"
msgstr "**Chart sa ibaba**: Ang paparating na pagtatantya ng site-averaged na $\\langle X \\rangle$ habang naiipon ang mga randomizations gamit ang magkaparehong shots kada randomization para sa parehong variant ng PEC. Ang PEC + error detection ay nagsa-settle sa band sa loob ng ilang libong randomizations; ang PEC-only, na binabayaran ang buong sampling overhead, ay nangangailangan ng mas maraming randomizations upang mag-converge.\n"

